<title>FINLAND: FINNISH ASKO 1996 PROFIT RISES 26 PCT.</title>
<headline>FINNISH ASKO 1996 PROFIT RISES 26 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
